  "scope": "The whole three-conclusion rectifiable coarea theorem of Federer 3.2.22, pp. 258\u2013260: exact tangent image or zero intrinsic mu-Jacobian almost everywhere on W; finite-mass (H^(m-mu),m-mu) rectifiable and measurable actual fibres almost everywhere on Z; weighted coarea for every extended-real integrable weight on exactly W. The source and target have precisely the printed finite-mass rectifiability and measurability hypotheses, m>=mu, and the Lipschitz partial map has exactly domain W and image in Z. No added rank, derivative-field, finite-fibre, intrinsic-Jacobian-measurability, ambient Radon or summability premise.",
