  "proof_route": "Extend the actual partial exterior-word comparison to every degree on regular source planes. Prove exact coordinate factorization on compact chart-pair parameter sets using full density and actual-differential uniqueness. Null target parameters force deficient rank or the exact tangent image. Prove intrinsic-Jacobian measurability by exact Borel coordinate representatives, opaque disjoint gluing and countably many distortion approximations. Establish finite fibre mass independently by the rough 2.10.25 estimate, and rectifiability/measurability by coordinate fibres and null remainders. Two injective area transformations and ordinary coarea, including the equal-dimension area/counting boundary, prove the local lambda^(2mu+2m) bounds. Corrected countable source/fibre sums and an extended-real power squeeze give the sharp identity on every measurable A subset W while retaining the original W Jacobian. Supported nonnegative characteristic expansion and an almost-everywhere bounded-density comparison prove the signed weighted identity without replacing integrability by summability. Restore the exact original f and g graphs, actual inner-integral domains and the outer Z cutoff.",
  "erratum_correction": "Erratum p. 5, book p. 258 lines 20/22 and p. 259 lines 3/4: add source remainder R=W minus source-chart union, distinct from target remainder Q, and retain its H^(m-mu)-null fibres almost everywhere.",
  "coverage_qualification": "The numbered theorem retains exactly the printed extended-real weights; a real-valued specialization is also provided. The p. 260 outer-measure typo is corrected to H^mu as in p. 258. All natural-dimension boundaries and actual partial domains are retained. Items 3.2.23\u20133.2.49 remain pending; this record does not certify them."
}
